{"4828450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bolsheviktion 2: Yurovsky's Revenge", "steam_appid": 4828450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4988370], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russia, 1920. Two years after the carnage you unleashed upon the communist regime in <i>Bolsheviktion 3D</i>, your marriage to the princess has produced a beautiful baby boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One stormy night, your son’s screams shatter your peaceful life. You find a ransom note, a trace of blood—and an empty crib.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You grab your pistol from the closet and give chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your son needs you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four epic acts. 16 sprawling Levels. 4 Secret Levels </strong>— From the comforts of Alexander Palace to the blood-stained tunnels of the gulags and the industrial heartland of post-revolutionary Russia, hunt your son’s captors without mercy—and kill any Bolshevik who gets in your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Enemy roster </strong>— Face nine distinct enemy types and four brutal end-of-act bosses—from dim-witted Brownshirts to the ferocious Black Guard and heavily armoured flamethrower troops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three new weapons </strong>— The four classic <i>Bolsheviktion 3D</i> weapons return, joined by the C96 pistol, a double-barrelled shotgun and a flamethrower for roasting Bolsheviks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four difficulty modes </strong>— Choose from <strong>Give Me a Go, Dad</strong>, <strong>Don’t Be So Tough</strong> and <strong>Let’s Go, Boys!</strong>—easy, medium and hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’re a professional? <strong>BOLSHEVIKTOR!</strong> mode awaits, and it is not even remotely fair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828450/extras/207f373437261e53b7520ced51b417d9.avif?t=1786898537\" width=336 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rubles &amp; Collectibles</strong> — Loot Bolshevik treasure and recover your son’s missing heirlooms. Spend your hard-earned rubles building a library of forbidden anti-Bolshevik books, each granting a powerful in-game perk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828450/extras/7275b346c6a09db95ca972f2a66178db.avif?t=1786898537\" alt=\"10 forbidden Anti Bolshevik Books\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828450/extras_big/7275b346c6a09db95ca972f2a66178db.webp?t=1786898537 width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smarter, Meaner Secrets</strong> — Wolfenstein-style pushwalls are only the beginning. Search for fake walls, hidden switches, pressure plates and rising or lowering platforms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>31-track original soundtrack -</strong> specially composed to match every level of the campaign, all in glorious MIDI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supercharged Retro Raycasting Engine</strong> — Built from the ground up in pure C, classic raycasting is massively expanded with true height variation, multi-level texture-mapped floors and ceilings, dynamic lighting, colour grading, skyboxes, animated textures and moving objects — all rendered in software.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russia, 1920. Two years after the carnage you unleashed upon the communist regime in <i>Bolsheviktion 3D</i>, your marriage to the princess has produced a beautiful baby boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One stormy night, your son’s screams shatter your peaceful life. You find a ransom note, a trace of blood—and an empty crib.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You grab your pistol from the closet and give chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your son needs you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four epic acts. 16 sprawling Levels. 4 Secret Levels </strong>— From the comforts of Alexander Palace to the blood-stained tunnels of the gulags and the industrial heartland of post-revolutionary Russia, hunt your son’s captors without mercy—and kill any Bolshevik who gets in your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Enemy roster </strong>— Face nine distinct enemy types and four brutal end-of-act bosses—from dim-witted Brownshirts to the ferocious Black Guard and heavily armoured flamethrower troops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three new weapons </strong>— The four classic <i>Bolsheviktion 3D</i> weapons return, joined by the C96 pistol, a double-barrelled shotgun and a flamethrower for roasting Bolsheviks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four difficulty modes </strong>— Choose from <strong>Give Me a Go, Dad</strong>, <strong>Don’t Be So Tough</strong> and <strong>Let’s Go, Boys!</strong>—easy, medium and hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’re a professional? <strong>BOLSHEVIKTOR!</strong> mode awaits, and it is not even remotely fair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828450/extras/207f373437261e53b7520ced51b417d9.avif?t=1786898537\" width=336 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rubles &amp; Collectibles</strong> — Loot Bolshevik treasure and recover your son’s missing heirlooms. Spend your hard-earned rubles building a library of forbidden anti-Bolshevik books, each granting a powerful in-game perk.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828450/extras/7275b346c6a09db95ca972f2a66178db.avif?t=1786898537\" alt=\"10 forbidden Anti Bolshevik Books\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828450/extras_big/7275b346c6a09db95ca972f2a66178db.webp?t=1786898537 width=1560 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smarter, Meaner Secrets</strong> — Wolfenstein-style pushwalls are only the beginning. Search for fake walls, hidden switches, pressure plates and rising or lowering platforms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>31-track original soundtrack -</strong> specially composed to match every level of the campaign, all in glorious MIDI.</p></li></u